[[7,1,0,"<p>Let the engine warm up (engine oil temperature 100°C).</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428961\">1084A42</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Operate the fuel pump using the tester&#x27;s &#x27;Active Diagnosis&#x27; setting\nand check the pressure does not exceed 4 bars.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.969.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect a pressure gauge to the adaptor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043617.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Start the engine only for the time required\nto check that the engine oil pressure is within the specified values.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Check delivery pressure (bar)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.7</p></td></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>Idle speed (-)</p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Check delivery pressure (bar)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>- (g/m.)</p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p>4000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the pressure gauge.</p><p>Remove the adaptor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.969.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428961\">1084A42</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]